              {
                "doseQuantity": {
                  "value": 1,
                  "unit": "tablet"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "note": [
          {
            "text": "Advised to take away from tea, coffee, and dairy where possible; may take with a small amount of food if gastrointestinal upset occurs. Warned about possible black stools, constipation, and nausea."
